David, to add to what Dean explained, if one used a geomorph internal function, called cs.scale (scaling by centroid size), then the answers are the same.

E.g.,

mu2 <- geomorph:::cs.scale(mshape(gpagen(X, Proj=FALSE)$coords))

This changes mu2 to be unit size, like the consensus.

Mike

